translate schinese hscene24_Erik_Lyna_Helga_328ea221:
    l "{size=-5}还有听着，老哥……"

translate schinese hscene24_Erik_Lyna_Helga_fa2dd488:
    l "{size=-5}这之后你可能会从我这儿得到一份非常特别的礼物……"

translate schinese hscene24_Erik_Lyna_Helga_c995eac7:
    e "{size=-5}*吞咽*那另一条毛、毛巾是干嘛的？"

translate schinese hscene24_Erik_Lyna_Helga_d62823fe:
    l "{size=-5}我们都知道妈妈那件浴袍里面没穿内衣。"

translate schinese hscene24_Erik_Lyna_Helga_6c672608:
    l "你们玩得开心！我这次真的走了！"

translate schinese hscene24_Erik_Lyna_Helga_ed8e787c:
    l "{size=-5}该死，这天气……{/size}今晚真暖和，对吧？？！"

translate schinese hscene24_Erik_Lyna_Helga_09ed01cd:
    em "唉，这个女孩……"

translate schinese hscene24_Erik_Lyna_Helga_c4aaf2dc:
