translate schinese hscene24_Erik_Lyna_Helga_d4539c10:
    h "{cps=30}别去。{w=0.35}你只要选遮住哪一部分，{w=0.35}对吧？"

translate schinese hscene24_Erik_Lyna_Helga_34a2d2ab:
    h "{cps=30}上面还是下面，{w=0.15}宝贝。{w=0.5}你选。"

translate schinese hscene24_Erik_Lyna_Helga_f5187e57:
    em "哇！我都认不出来了。这真的是我妈妈吗？！"

translate schinese hscene24_Erik_Lyna_Helga_598e6411:
