translate schinese hscene24_Erik_Lyna_Helga_ba53b9a2:
    h "看？*打嗝*没什么大不了的！"

translate schinese hscene24_Erik_Lyna_Helga_38d76c5d:
    em "加油埃里克，呼吸！别让她看到你硬了，现在不行……"

translate schinese hscene24_Erik_Lyna_Helga_c40a4857:
    e "妈妈这不对……呃……"

translate schinese hscene24_Erik_Lyna_Helga_e9e2aae2:
    h "天啊，你害羞起来真是该死地可爱！"

translate schinese hscene24_Erik_Lyna_Helga_94563ac6:
