translate schinese hscene24_Erik_Lyna_Helga_ad0a8625:
    e "呃……{size=-5}呃……"

translate schinese hscene24_Erik_Lyna_Helga_67c08635:
    h "只是我，你妈妈。你可以转过来了。"

translate schinese hscene24_Erik_Lyna_Helga_da88ba21:
