translate schinese hscene24_Erik_Lyna_Helga_8181ec73:
    h "我全心全意信任你。{size=-5}我知道你会守规矩……"

translate schinese hscene24_Erik_Lyna_Helga_ea39c045:
    em "她那话到底是什么意思？！"

translate schinese hscene24_Erik_Lyna_Helga_cbf586a6:
